		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> drawn on a weapon or unarmed attack that deals piercing or slashing damage</p><hr><p>This cuspate rune, when placed on a blade, ensures it won't go dull. Strikes with the weapon or unarmed attack deal an extra 2 persistent bleed damage per weapon damage die.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e-runesmith-assistant.pf2e-runesmith-assistant-items.Item.Bq9YEJ6OvXHgE8j4]{Effect: Esvadir, Rune of Whetstones}</p><p><strong>Invocation </strong>A blast of cutting energy is released outward from the rune, dealing @Damage[ceil(@actor.level / 2)d8[slashing]] damage to a creature adjacent to the rune-bearer, with a @Check[reflex|basic|against:runesmith] save.</p><hr><p><strong>Level (+2)</strong> The damage of the invocation increases by [[/r 1d8]].</p>"
